00:44:55,000 --> 00:45:01,000
Cheaper by the Dozen is a 2003 American comedy film directed by Shawn Levy.

12
00:49:00,000 --> 00:49:06,000
It is a remake of the 1950 film of the same name.

13
00:53:05,000 --> 00:53:11,000
Both films were inspired by the semi-autobiographical book
Cheaper by the Dozen by Frank Bunker Gilbreth Jr.

14
00:57:10,000 --> 00:57:16,000
and his sister Ernestine Gilbreth Carey.

15
01:01:15,000 --> 01:01:21,000
It stars Steve Martin, Bonnie Hunt, Hilary Duff, Tom
Welling, and Piper Perabo, alongside Kevin G.

