Schmidt, Alyson Stoner, Jacob Smith, Forrest Landis, Liliana Mumy, Morgan York, Blake
Woodruff, Brent and Shane Kinsman, Paula Marshall, and Alan Ruck in supporting roles.

17
01:09:25,000 --> 01:09:31,000
Outside of a passing mention of the Gilbreth name, the film has
little connection with the original source material.

18
01:13:30,000 --> 01:13:36,000
The film was released on December 25, 2003, by 20th Century Fox and
grossed $190 million worldwide against a $40 million budget.

